What is here

The exams: the three versions of the exam (A, B and C), as they were given.
Answers for all three versions: the correct answer to every question in each version, and where to find each question in the other versions.
Version A, explained: all 45 questions of Version A, on one page. For each question you see:

the question and all its answer choices. The correct answer is in larger bold text;
under each choice, in smaller italic text, why that choice is correct or wrong;
a short Background section that explains the material behind the question;
links to the parts of the course book that cover it.
